OL,3,GNEWSAMan charged with owning
OL,4,Aout-of-control dogs
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has been charged with several
OL,7,Foffences of owning a dog dangerously
OL,8,Fout of control in Leeds.
OL,10,FMohammed Khangostar, 42, was arrested
OL,11,Fon Saturday on Beckhill Approach in
OL,12,FMeanwood after "concerns and reports
OL,13,Fmade by local residents" following
OL,14,Fincidents between 29 July and 14
OL,15,FAugust, according to West Yorkshire
OL,16,FPolice.
OL,18,FTwo dogs were also seized from a
OL,19,Fproperty on the same road, a force
OL,20,Fspokesperson said.
OL,23,APub: 08-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
