OL,3,GNEWSAMan charged with owning
OL,4,Aout-of-control dogs
OL,5,
OL,6,FKhangostar was later charged with five
OL,7,Fcounts of being the owner of a dog
OL,8,Fdangerously out of control and he was
OL,9,Freleased on bail, they added. He is due
OL,10,Fto appear before Leeds Magistrates'
OL,11,FCourt on Tuesday 24 November.
